# Cloudflare Pages publishes ONLY `public/` (deploy.yml `directory: public`).
# Nothing outside public/ is served at adrific.fi, so the project docs below are
# now version-controlled here in the (private) repo. Keep anything secret or
# deploy-bound out of public/ — that folder, and only that folder, ships.

